<title>POLAND: SANOK JULY NET FLAT AT PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>SANOK JULY NET FLAT AT PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.21 vs   1.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.03 vs   1.23</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.47 vs   1.00</p>
<p> Sales		   14.13 vs  11.40</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.66 vs   9.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.53 vs   9.63</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.45 vs   9.74</p>
<p> Sales		   95.14 vs  81.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish rubber products maker is Stomil</p>
<p>Sanok SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
